All 6 LLM providers you support offer some form of constrained decoding for JSON structured outputs. Here's the detailed    
  breakdown:                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                              
  ---                                                                                                                         
  1. OpenAI ✅ Full Support                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                              
  Feature: Structured Outputs (strict schema adherence) + JSON Mode                                                           
                                                                                                                              
  How it works:                                                                                                               
  - Uses response_format parameter with type: "json_schema" and strict: true                                                  
  - Compiles JSON Schema into grammar that constrains token generation                                                        
  - Guarantees 100% schema compliance                                                                                         
                                                                                                                              
  API Implementation:                                                                                                         
  {                                                                                                                           
    "response_format": {                                                                                                      
      "type": "json_schema",                                                                                                  
      "json_schema": {                                                                                                        
        "name": "my_schema",                                                                                                  
        "strict": true,                                                                                                       
        "schema": { /* JSON Schema */ }                                                                                       
      }                                                                                                                       
    }                                                                                                                         
  }                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                              
  Supported Models: gpt-4o, gpt-4o-mini (2024-08-06 and later)                                                                
                                                                                                                              
  Sources: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/structured-outputs,                                                  
  https://openai.com/index/introducing-structured-outputs-in-the-api/                                                         
                                                                                                                              
  ---                                                                                                                         
  2. Claude (Anthropic) ✅ Full Support                                                                                       
                                                                                                                              
  Feature: Structured Outputs with constrained sampling + Strict Tool Use                                                     
                                                                                                                              
  How it works:                                                                                                               
  - Uses output_config.format for JSON output format                                                                          
  - Compiles JSON Schema into grammar artifacts                                                                               
  - Uses constrained sampling during inference - model cannot produce invalid tokens                                          
  - Grammar caching for 24 hours improves latency on repeated schemas                                                         
                                                                                                                              
  API Implementation:                                                                                                         
  {                                                                                                                           
    "output_config": {                                                                                                        
      "format": {                                                                                                             
        "type": "json_schema",                                                                                                
        "json_schema": { /* JSON Schema */ }                                                                                  
      }                                                                                                                       
    }                                                                                                                         
  }                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                              
  Supported Models: Claude Opus 4.5/4.6, Claude Sonnet 4.5/4.6, Claude Haiku 4.5                                              
                                                                                                                              
  Sources: https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/build-with-claude/structured-outputs,                                              
  https://tessl.io/blog/anthropic-brings-structured-outputs-to-claude-developer-platform-making-api-responses-more-reliable/  
                                                                                                                              
  ---                                                                                                                         
  3. Google Gemini ✅ Full Support                                                                                            
                                                                                                                              
  Feature: Structured Outputs with JSON Schema                                                                                
                                                                                                                              
  How it works:                                                                                                               
  - Uses response_schema parameter with full JSON Schema support                                                              
  - Supports anyOf, $ref, and other JSON Schema keywords                                                                      
  - Preserves property ordering from schema (Gemini 2.5+)                                                                     
  - Works with Pydantic/Zod libraries out-of-the-box                                                                          
                                                                                                                              
  API Implementation:                                                                                                         
  {                                                                                                                           
    "generationConfig": {                                                                                                     
      "responseMimeType": "application/json",                                                                                 
      "responseSchema": { /* JSON Schema */ }                                                                                 
    }                                                                                                                         
  }                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                              
  Supported Models: All Gemini 2.5+ models, Gemini 3                                                                          
                                                                                                                              
  Sources: https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/structured-output,                                                           
  https://blog.google/technology/developers/gemini-api-structured-outputs/                                                    
                                                                                                                              
  ---                                                                                                                         
  4. Grok (xAI) ✅ Full Support                                                                                               
                                                                                                                              
  Feature: Structured Outputs with JSON Schema                                                                                
                                                                                                                              
  How it works:                                                                                                               
  - Uses response_format parameter (OpenAI-compatible)                                                                        
  - Supports json_object mode and json_schema mode                                                                            
  - Compatible with Pydantic models via xAI SDK                                                                               
  - Supports streaming structured responses                                                                                   
                                                                                                                              
  API Implementation:                                                                                                         
  {                                                                                                                           
    "response_format": {                                                                                                      
      "type": "json_schema",                                                                                                  
      "json_schema": {                                                                                                        
        "name": "my_schema",                                                                                                  
        "schema": { /* JSON Schema */ }                                                                                       
      }                                                                                                                       
    }                                                                                                                         
  }                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                              
  Supported Models: Grok 3, Grok 4                                                                                            
                                                                                                                              
  Sources: https://docs.x.ai/developers/model-capabilities/text/structured-outputs,                                           
  https://python.useinstructor.com/integrations/xai/                                                                          
                                                                                                                              
  ---                                                                                                                         
  5. DeepSeek ⚠️ Partial Support (JSON Mode only)                                                                             
                                                                                                                              
  Feature: JSON Mode (no strict schema enforcement)                                                                           
                                                                                                                              
  How it works:                                                                                                               
  - Uses response_format: { "type": "json_object" }                                                                           
  - Requires "json" keyword in system/user prompt                                                                             
  - Must provide example JSON format in prompt                                                                                
  - Does NOT guarantee strict schema adherence                                                                                
  - Reasoning models (R1) output JSON after </think> tags                                                                     
                                                                                                                              
  API Implementation:                                                                                                         
  {                                                                                                                           
    "response_format": { "type": "json_object" },                                                                             
    "max_tokens": 4096                                                                                                        
  }                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                              
  Limitations:                                                                                                                
  - No native JSON Schema validation                                                                                          
  - May omit optional fields or misinterpret types                                                                            
  - Requires careful prompt engineering for complex schemas                                                                   
                                                                                                                              
  Sources: https://api-docs.deepseek.com/guides/json_mode, https://www.byteplus.com/en/topic/404926                           
                                                                                                                              
  ---                                                                                                                         
  6. Kimi (Moonshot AI) ✅ Full Support                                                                                       
                                                                                                                              
  Feature: JSON Mode with JSON Schema support                                                                                 
                                                                                                                              
  How it works:                                                                                                               
  - OpenAI-compatible API format                                                                                              
  - Supports response_format with JSON mode                                                                                   
  - JSON Schema support for structured outputs                                                                                
  - 256K context window in Kimi K2.5                                                                                          
                                                                                                                              
  API Implementation:                                                                                                         
  {                                                                                                                           
    "response_format": { "type": "json_object" }                                                                              
  }                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                              
  Supported Models: Kimi K2, Kimi K2.5                                                                                        
                                                                                                                              
  Sources: https://platform.moonshot.ai/docs/guide/use-json-mode-feature-of-kimi-api,                                         
  https://platform.moonshot.ai/docs/guide/kimi-k2-5-quickstart                                                                
                                                                                                                              
